in="00:42.298" end="00:42.818">hill</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.638" end="00:44.748"><span begin="00:42.638" end="00:42.848">There's </span><span begin="00:42.848" end="00:43.058">a </span><span begin="00:43.058" end="00:43.978">plastic </span><span begin="00:43.978" end="00:44.748">tree</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.698" end="00:48.618"><span begin="00:46.698" end="00:46.908">Are </span><span begin="00:46.908" end="00:47.118">you </span><span begin="00:47.118" end="00:47.488">here </span><span begin="00:47.488" end="00:47.978">with </span><span begin="00:47.978" end="00:48.618">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.888" end="00:54.688"><span begin="00:51.888" end="00:52.118">Just </span><span begin="00:52.118" end="00:52.908">looking </span><span begin="00:52.908" end="00:53.188">out </span><span begin="00:53.188" end="00:53.398">on </span><span begin="00:53.398" end="00:53.668">the </span><span begin="00:53.668" end="00:54.688">day</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.537" end="00:56.757"><span begin="00:54.537" end="00:54.737">Of </span><span begin="00:54.737" end="00:55.747">another </span><span begin="00:55.747" end="00:56.757">dream</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.897" end="01:02.417"><span begin="00:59.897" end="01:00.097">Well </span><span begin="01:00.097" end="01:00.407">you </span><span begin="01:00.407" end="01:00.897">can't </span><span begin="01:00.897" end="01:01.227">get </span><span begin="01:01.227" end="01:01.427">what </span><span begin="01:01.427" end="01:01.737">you </span><span begin="01:01.737" end="01:02.417">want</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.416" end="01:04.716"><span begin="01:02.416" end="01:02.676">But </span><span begin="01:02.676" end="01:02.926">you </span><span begin="01:02.926" end="01:03.466">can </span><span begin="01:03.466" end="01:04.016">get </span><span begin="01:04.016" end="01:04.716">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.586" end="01:09.005"><span begin="01:06.586" end="01:06.796">So </span><span begin="01:06.796" end="01:06.966">let's </span><span begin="01:06.966" end="01:07.256">set </span><span begin="01:07.256" end="01:07.716">up </span><span begin="01:07.716" end="01:07.976">and </span><span begin="01:07.976" end="01:09.005">see</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.825" end="01:14.154"><span begin="01:11.825" end="01:12.015">'Cause </span><span begin="01:12.015" end="01:12.524">you </span><span begin="01:12.524" end="01:12.884">are </span><span begin="01:12.884" end="01:13.134">my </span><span begin="01:13.134" end="01:14.154">medicine</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.284" end="01:16.463"><span begin="01:14.284" end="01:14.544">When </span><span begin="01:14.544" end="01:14.864">you're </span><span begin="01:14.864" end="01:15.364">close </span><span begin="01:15.364" end="01:15.834">to </span><span begin="01:15.834" end="01:16.463">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.583" end="01:20.563"><span begin="01:18.583" end="01:18.773">When </span><span begin="01:18.773" end="01:18.953">you're </span><span begin="01:18.953" end="01:19.423">close </span><span begin="01:19.423" end="01:19.933">to </span><span begin="01:19.933" end="01:20.563">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.792" end="01:42.212"><span begin="01:39.792" end="01:39.992">So </span><span begin="01:39.992" end="01:40.442">call </span><span begin="01:40.442" end="01:40.832">in </span><span begin="01:40.832" end="01:41.122">the </span><span begin="01:41.122" end="01:42.212">submarine</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.212" end="01:44.481"><span begin="01:42.212" end="01:42.601">'Round </span><span begin="01:42.601" end="01:42.811">the </span><span begin="01:42.811" end="01:43.331">world </span><span begin="01:43.331" end="01:43.851">will </span><span begin="01:43.851" end="01:44.481">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.781" end="01:48.591"><span begin="01:46.781" end="01:47.001">Does </span><span begin="01:47.001" end="01:4